    warm:'Hi {recipient},\n\nThanks for the updated quote. {context} {detail}\n\nI would like to find a workable path if possible.\n\nBest,',direct:'Hi {recipient},\n\n{context} {detail}\n\nPlease confirm which option is available.\n\nBest,',formal:'Dear {recipient},\n\nThank you for the revised proposal. {context} {detail}\n\nPlease confirm the available options in writing.\n\nKind regards,',
